 Operation             Time                Reason                   
 Access            | O(1)           | Direct indexing          
 Update            | O(1)           | Replace existing value   
 Traversal         | O(n)           | Visit every element      
 Search (unsorted) | O(n)           | May inspect all elements 
 Search (sorted)   | O(log n)       | Binary search            
 Insert at end     | Amortized O(1) | Dynamic array append     
 Insert at middle  | O(n)           | Shift elements           
 Delete            | O(n)           | Shift elements           
